referenceFunction.generalComment:
This process is based on the dataset "water, deionised, at plant/kg/CH U" from Ecoinvent v2.2. The electricity consumption is regionalised. The water withdrawal and water emissions to water are regionalised. The water embodied in product (1 kg/kg) is not included and has to be accounted for in the processes, which use deionised water. Large uncertainties exist due to influence of raw water quality and operation mode on regeneration chemical demand and electricity used.;
CAS number: 007732-18-5; 
Formula: H2O; 
UUID: d105585b-ecf1-37fd-84e1-f72fbb7a78f8
